@startuml
actor Student
participant ScienceStudyPlannerActivity as UI
participant GenerateStudyPlanUseCase as UseCase
participant ScienceStudyPlanGenerator as Generator
participant StudyPlanRepository as Repository

Student -> UI: Choose subject, level, goal, days, minutes
Student -> UI: Press Generate
UI -> UI: capture createdAt = current timestamp
UI -> UseCase: execute(StudyPlanRequest(createdAt))
UseCase -> Generator: generate(request)
alt Gemini content succeeds
  Generator --> UseCase: AI session titles/activities
else missing key/network/invalid response
  Generator --> UseCase: local fallback content
end
UseCase -> UseCase: first session = createdAt\nsubsequent sessions = +1 day
UseCase -> Repository: save encrypted plan
UseCase --> UI: StudyPlan
UI --> Student: Show created time and exact first-session time
Student -> UI: Tick completed session
UI -> Repository: save updated completion state(best effort)
@enduml
